            <div xml:id="m-f3816fa8-f5c5-473a-8f80-531c38fe7261">
              <lg xml:id="m-b9172315-f7f3-4cba-b4b5-4804c4aed4cf">
                <l xml:id="m-c2011c6b-5654-42fc-88ac-253ac768062e" facs="#m-57578f24-3a89-4b43-b62b-c7a8b24faa53" label="text-like">Second Sunday of the Passion</l><l xml:id="m-bf60546e-d7c6-4c27-9182-a36e54723326" facs="#m-c2576a0e-95bc-4f20-8820-cdff1996a037" label="ambiguous">586</l><l xml:id="m-3615dd8d-a063-4dae-80e9-002cf5aed5db" facs="#m-ce133d73-660a-49da-8a6e-2643334097a6" label="lyrics-like">bus quas víde-rant virtú-ti-bus, di-céntes: « Be-ne-díctus</l><l xml:id="m-225c2fa9-c8fc-4233-a95e-656fe182d233" facs="#m-a1975cf4-5d44-4efb-8bf3-dfd8ae5c34ae" label="lyrics-like">qui vé-nit Rex in nómine Dómi-ni; pax in térra, et gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-fffaca1d-cdc5-4480-b2e8-94e02a064aa1" facs="#m-a2b10e5b-e541-4424-bf07-ea043f55656f" label="lyrics-like">ri-a in excél-sis».</l><l xml:id="m-e52157ef-29e6-417c-be9d-08d3f687b29a" facs="#m-f4e1c4ed-e4c5-4d1f-9c66-bdd6f96ee5d4" label="text-like">19. In the course of the procession the follouinɇ hymn is sung. If possible,</l><l xml:id="m-b9ab75db-3b49-4cc3-ad87-e5955ce79a33" facs="#m-b163590b-d79c-45a0-85de-8823eabefb3d" label="lyrics-like">the whole congregation should sing each time the first three lines (Glória laus)</l><l xml:id="m-0e837a28-44f2-40c5-b00f-46b16e1fe74c" facs="#m-ef789466-b7c9-4ad4-a908-ec8b298ec532" label="ambiguous">as shewon beloro.</l><l xml:id="m-b6345553-ae85-4571-ab8f-a142e491241f" facs="#m-c152286a-c37d-4e2f-a2be-8d22fd782a59" label="text-like">HYMN TO CHRIST THE KING</l><l xml:id="m-ca9754bf-2a21-48c6-bcd6-0c2371aaa1e1" facs="#m-493b98db-6c95-4036-9893-6d1e3d1dcc80" label="text-like">The choir:</l><l xml:id="m-8c075621-c902-4f3d-b6a0-4be8ead05381" facs="#m-556b4e01-02fb-4cc0-b118-146fc594a3ea" label="lyrics-like">Theodulf, Bishop of Orléans f 821</l><l xml:id="m-80835c7f-f3d2-4b8f-b137-00d0847ba56b" facs="#m-c5ba9045-fd35-4738-8144-5580eacabfc7" label="lyrics-like">Ló-ri-a, laus et hónor tí-bi sit,</l><l xml:id="m-19268808-504d-4d8b-9a99-7544d2abada4" facs="#m-ebc9f608-8a60-4b56-9967-3798e8c71368" label="ambiguous">Rex Christe</l><l xml:id="m-e256eaa4-d1dd-42b1-8e69-c4cee40818d3" facs="#m-dcece5b2-246b-4ac7-9bce-24b582a7c0d3" label="lyrics-like">Redémptor: Cú-i pu-e- rí-le dé-cus prómpsit Hosán¬</l><l xml:id="m-b7c9bc9d-ac03-4c15-93dc-568a1c2e5c65" facs="#m-dd7b8d4b-cb76-47f8-974c-465b3e9cb04c" label="lyrics-like">na pí- um.</l><l xml:id="m-47d1b5af-b61e-4dc1-8708-60df0a7ef20e" facs="#m-d777940a-3518-4eb8-a23a-9574118ddcf8" label="lyrics-like">All : Glória, laus.</l><l xml:id="m-415c5752-d9cd-4a29-863c-306713554511" facs="#m-b67cdac8-383b-4419-b955-8304d5713d87" label="text-like">The choir:</l><l xml:id="m-61fc32c3-675a-42bf-b881-f75f2e97fca2" facs="#m-4786a086-9c44-426f-9373-25bbbda5331c" label="lyrics-like">I. Isra-ël es tu Rex, Davídis et íncli-ta pró-les: Nómine</l><l xml:id="m-dcb7ddf4-9526-49aa-aa70-0f15bf2fc389" facs="#m-1ce1daa5-e421-4942-8f66-01d3489a4a32" label="lyrics-like">qui in Dómi-ni, Rex benedícte, vénis.</l><l xml:id="m-c38e9798-8236-464f-9b0b-5f09d1943b91" facs="#m-d29efbf5-bc00-4de0-9f2a-8475910e57bf" label="lyrics-like">Aul : Glória, laus.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>